category: Libs
requires: libtrexio2
sdesc: "File format and library for the storage of quantum chemical wave functions (development)"
ldesc: "TREXIO is an open-source file format and library developed for the storage and
manipulation of data produced by quantum chemistry calculations. It was
designed with the goal of providing a reliable and efficient method of storing
and exchanging wave function parameters and matrix elements."
external-source: trexio

